  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In private thought He Feng Yang treats her battle strength as similar to his own and counts at least three mortal killer moves on her side for the Hu Immortal blessed land attack.",
      "chapters": [
        669
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_feng_yang",
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At a later sect meeting Lei Tan calls her decent among rank six Gu Immortals while mocking the size of the planned strike force.",
      "chapters": [
        697
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lei_tan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a young and beautiful looking woman. She has a good figure and a face like a peach. Her eyes are thin and delicate. She wears a pink-blue flowery dress that flutters in the wind.",
      "chapters": [
        698
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She has ten dainty fingers.",
      "chapters": [
        700
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She arrives on Tian Ti with He Feng Yang as another Gu Immortal of Immortal Crane Sect, young in appearance, in a pink-blue flowery dress. He praises her investigative killer move micro sense, which can sell for five immortal essence stones in treasure yellow heaven; she answers that she obtained it from a fortuitous encounter in the reincarnation battlefield. Rather than share his white cloud cushion, she flicks a wood path Gu that grows peach trees into a bed and rests there while they wait. Gu Immortals of the other nine ancient sects already lurk nearby watching their move.",
      "chapters": [
        698
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tian-ti-approach",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tian_ti",
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan forces introductions, she names herself Cang Yu, a rank six water path Gu Immortal of Immortal Crane Sect. She answers his sarcasm by offering to fight to the end rather than waste words, and he reads their aim as Dang Hun Mountain guts Gu, which He Feng Yang admits.",
      "chapters": [
        701
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "defeat-at-hu-immortal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_dang_hun_mountain",
        "gu_guts_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She walks Dang Hun Mountain with Fang Yuan watching guts Gu growth while He Feng Yang returns with sect terms: subsidiary status without time limit, guts Gu trade at one immortal essence stone for a hundred and twenty, and Promise Immortal Gu to seal the bargain. After that exchange she finally breathes in relief, and Fang Yuan sends both Immortal Crane Sect immortals out.",
      "chapters": [
        705
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "subsidiary-trade-and-exit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
